        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2987288f-c1a4-4894-80ab-30761adbf58f).Image",
        "Description": "Throwing the Kashmirian off the building in Marrakesh worked, 47; our mole, Dexy Brat, fled to Bangkok to redezvous with an old asset of ours, Jeremy Gordon, code name: &apos;Bones&apos;, to aqcuire a new identity.  He has provided good intel in the past but intercepted emails prove that his loyalty is too easily purchased. It turns out his primary revenue stream comes from his dark web website that sells countless disturbing  videos of &quot;Thailand&apos;s Finest Little Flowers.&quot;  Dexy Barat is Blackmailing him.",
